{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"customer-acquisition-cost-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"am","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"customer-acquisition-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["customer-acquisition-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"am","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"ከተመሳሳይ ወቅት እና የማግኘት ስፋት ወጪዎች እና ደንበኞችን ቁጥር. CAC አንድ የተቀላቀለ አማካይ ነው, አይደለም marginal CAC ወይም ማስረጃ አንድ ዘመቻ በእያንዳንዱ ሽያጭ ምክንያት ነው. Payback እንደ ቀላል ወርሃዊ ግማሽ-ትርፍ ትንበያ ገቢ × ግማሽ-ትርፍ ጥቅም ላይ ይውላል; ይህ churn, የክፍያ ጊዜ, ግብር, overhead እና የሚለውጡ ደንበኛ cohorts ያጠቃልላል. የገንዘብ ምክር አይደለም.","record_id":"9bff4115be5a2f9ff4afa988f191f08c441d5e876c2ef5021aeaccc4f69fef84","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.384867637125012,"source":"Count costs and customers from the same period and acquisition scope. CAC is a blended average, not marginal CAC or proof that a campaign caused each sale. Payback uses revenue × gross margin as a simple monthly gross-profit estimate; it excludes churn, payment timing, taxes, overhead and changing customer cohorts. Not financial advice.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"de0b7da85b2dffb15d66079c047738bf004714d2b5d708c63411072962b4c46b","status":"machine-draft","translation":"ከተመሳሳይ ወቅት እና የማግኘት ስፋት ወጪዎች እና ደንበኞችን ቁጥር. CAC አንድ የተቀላቀለ አማካይ ነው, አይደለም marginal CAC ወይም ማስረጃ አንድ ዘመቻ በእያንዳንዱ ሽያጭ ምክንያት ነው. Payback እንደ ቀላል ወርሃዊ ግማሽ-ትርፍ ትንበያ ገቢ × ግማሽ-ትርፍ ጥቅም ላይ ይውላል; ይህ churn, የክፍያ ጊዜ, ግብር, overhead እና የሚለውጡ ደንበኛ cohorts ያጠቃልላል. የገንዘብ ምክር አይደለም.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
